                            <comment id="16370207" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 20 Feb 2018 16:12:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt;, it seems only 2 tests failing&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1103443&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAllNet&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=1103443&amp;amp;tab=buildResultsDiv&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAllNet&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am not sure it is related to WAL mode&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;PersistenceTest.TestCacheDataSurvivesNodeRestart&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;PersistenceTest.TestCacheDataSurvivesNodeRestart&lt;/li&gt;
