</comment>
                            <comment id="16370242" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 20 Feb 2018 16:35:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yes, this is unrelated.&lt;br/&gt;
That metrics check is quite pointless, I would simply remove &lt;tt&gt;Assert.Greater(metrics.WalFsyncTimeAverage, 0);&lt;/tt&gt; line from &lt;tt&gt;PersistenceTest.cs&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16370627" author="ilantukh" created="Tue, 20 Feb 2018 21:42:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;As far as I understand, those failures happened because now there are no FSYNCs with default settings, and so WalFsyncTimeAverage == 0. I&apos;ve added fix to my PR.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16371034" author="ptupitsyn" created="Wed, 21 Feb 2018 07:07:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilantukh&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilantukh&quot;&gt;ilantukh&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

